    "title": "How restaurants are using robots and AI to improve their bottom line - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago ST PAUL, Minn. — At Upin Hot Pot restaurant in Brooklyn Park, owner Shan Lin is no stranger to adaptation. After 30 years in the restaurant business, Lin opened his latest venture last year and decided to introduce robotic helpers to his dining room. The two robots deliver food directly from the kitchen to tables, lightening the load for his servers and freeing them to do other tasks. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
